# Sitecore Content SDK — Monorepo

**Primary:** [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md) — commands, package structure, boundaries, DO/DON'T.

**Layering:** [`CLAUDE.md`](CLAUDE.md) — start with `AGENTS.md`; open one [`.cursor/rules/`](.cursor/rules/) file when the task needs it.

**Capabilities:** [`Skills.md`](Skills.md) — template skills under `packages/create-content-sdk-app/src/templates/`.

**Commands:** `yarn install`, `yarn build`, `yarn test-packages`, `yarn lint-packages`. Never edit `dist/**` or commit secrets.

**Docs:** [Content SDK](https://doc.sitecore.com/sai/en/developers/content-sdk/sitecore-content-sdk-for-sitecoreai.html)
